Z||000018||btoth||11-06-2001||02:34 PM||||I'd prefer an Audi A4 (or even better, a TT Turbo) over a WRX.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  We have an A6 that is nice except for the fact that the brake pedal is right next to the gas pedal - must have been designed by someone with small feet.  I can't drive the thing very well with my foot getting stuck under the dash.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">  But the handling is extremely good for a big station wagon.||||reg||1
